To optimize the function to have a time complexity of O(n), we can eliminate the recursion and instead use a formula to calculate the Fibonacci sequence directly. The formula is:

F(n) = ( (1 + sqrt(5))^n - (1 - sqrt(5))^n ) / ( 2^n * sqrt(5) )

Here's the modified function using the formula:

