To optimize the function to have a time complexity of O(1), you can use the matrix exponentiation method to calculate the Fibonacci sequence directly. This method uses the following formula:

```
| F(n)   |   =   | 1  1 |  ^ (n-1)  *  | F(1)  |
| F(n-1) |         | 1  0 |             | F(0)  |
